  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
Welcome 🙏 So glad you're here.

Here's a simple starting point — three core scriptures that form the foundation of Guan Yin Citta practice:

📿 **《Chien Shou Chien Yan Wu Ai Ta Pei Hsin To Lo Ni》(Great Compassion Mantra)** — 3 times daily
Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me good health and strengthen my spiritual power."*

📿 **《Po Jo Po Lo Mi To Hsin Ching》(Heart Sutra)** — 3 times daily
Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me wisdom, a clear and calm mind, and eliminate worries."*
⚠️ Do not recite after 10pm

📿 **《Eighty-Eight Buddhas Great Repentance》** — 1 time daily
Before reciting, say:
*"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], help me to repent and eliminate karmic obstacles."*
⚠️ Do not recite after 10pm

Don't worry if you don't know the words yet — follow along with the teaching videos here:
🔗 https://xinlingfamen.info/jingwen/

Consistency matters more than quantity. Starting with 3 times each and keeping it up daily is already a beautiful beginning 🙏

